            <Title>MarketingStrategy </Title>
            <Text>1. Linked content, to art illustrations and a live questionarre with limited 10 questions to be answered by the author. And access to the author’s illustration comment feed. 

1. Linked up with an Instagram account this helps the author get feedback from those that have paid a premium for the content. 

2. Posters with the QR Content. Give also out a commission with where a purchase is made by the link they will get a % of the purchase for their work in distributing the material. This allows the pamphlets to fly. 

2.1 Each distributers QR is assigned to their QR scan code on the flyer.</Text>
