_____________________________________________________________
There should be something discreet that instills confidence in Tebo’s plan to get the crew to Oasis, here The Gates are referred to as Couriers. To instill the image of a feasable and possible way out, given their current lack of knowledge in the Technology a plan is made with positive manipulation based on the limits and scopes of their current mental capacity. 
_____________________________________________________________
The gate is disguised as a passing asteroid, at which the beverly enters into cloaking it’s journey. The grey class ship; trails the beverly based on light distortion tracking, the ships engines are far advanced , thus leaving no vapour or gaseous decay signature, all these bi products of the drice are captured while operating in cloaked mode, with the reduced low enerfy consumption. 
- Space tracking of vessels and asteroids. 
- Ground based radar, reveals distance velocity and shape rotation. 
Counter measures, 
EM tracking would need to be deflected or cloaked by a continued projection of the incoming magnetic field. 
- This could be used to detect an incoming ship but, at a cost of giving away postiion, on a hot burn this would be the time to use such a technology. 
The skin of the ship would beed to counter the EM tech in that moment when it went cold, the AI modes of the ship would only be primitive. 
